[00:01.08]1. There was a reason why God brought the truth to you
[00:08.64]And called you from the darkness to the light.
[00:14.82]Within your heart, he saw the longing that you had
[00:21.34]To search for him and practice what is right.
[00:28.42]You promised him in prayer to do his will;
[00:34.96]He helped you then, and he will help you still.
[00:41.40](Chorus)
[00:41.96]With Jesus’ blood He bought you,
[00:45.48]to God you now belong.
[00:48.22]So he will make you firm,
[00:51.54]and he will make you strong.
[00:54.92]He’ll guide you and protect you,
[00:57.92]as he has all along.
[01:02.12]Yes, he will make you firm,
[01:05.94]and he will make you strong.
[02:47.80]2. God gave his own beloved Son in your behalf;
[02:55.34]On this account, He wants you to succeed.
[03:01.02]If He did not withhold the gift of His dear Son,
[03:08.18]Then never doubt He’ll give the strength you need.
[03:14.90]He won’t forget the faith and love you’ve shown;
[03:21.24]He will not fail to care for all His own.
[03:28.08](Chorus)
[03:28.54]With Jesus’ blood He bought you,
[03:31.46]to God you now belong.
[03:34.76]So he will make you firm,
[03:38.34]and he will make you strong.
[03:41.56]He’ll guide you and protect you,
[03:44.54]as he has all along.
[03:48.74]Yes, he will make you firm,
[03:52.08]and he will make you strong.
